   "notes": "19 Trinity St: dark purple-brown brick with rubbed red brick giant pilaster strips (Ionic capitals) and window architraves, pediment over the central first-floor window, carved frieze and cornice; three segmental-headed dormers in a shaped parapet. Ground floor: Toast shopfront (arched timber glazing) and a granite-framed passage to Heffers on the south side."
